+### CherryPy
+
+Add the Mapkick static-file configuration to your CherryPy application
+
+```python
+import cherrypy
+from mapkick.flask import Map, mapkick_blueprint
+
+class Root:
+    @cherrypy.expose
+    def index(self):
+        return '<script src="/static/mapkick/mapkick.bundle.js"></script>{}'.format(Map([
+            {'latitude': 37.7829, 'longitude': -122.4190}
+        ]))
+
+cherrypy.quickstart(Root(), config=mapkick_blueprint.config)
 ```
 
